advisor.advisor_job_titles_user_prompt_template:
Based on the resume corpus, the job packets, and compatibility scores, recommend 3-5 job titles that best fit the resume. Keep each item short: title plus a brief fit note.

Resume corpus:
{resume_corpus}

Job packets summary:
{job_packets}

advisor.advisor_general_advice_user_prompt_templ:
Using the resume corpus and job packets, write one concise summary of the current job fit and one general advice paragraph. Keep everything practical and brief. The general_advice field must be a single paragraph, not bullets, with complete sentences.

Resume corpus:
{resume_corpus}

Job packets summary:
{job_packets}

advisor.advisor_recommendations_bundle_user_prom:
Using the resume corpus and job packets, produce one concise summary and one general advice paragraph for the top section, plus the other sections. Keep the output practical and brief. Job titles should fit the resume and the packet compatibility. Resume recommendations should improve hireability without inventing experience. Interview prep, ATS keyword gaps, and portfolio suggestions should be short and specific. The general_advice field must be a single paragraph, not bullets, with complete sentences.

Resume corpus:
{resume_corpus}

Job packets summary:
{job_packets}

advisor.advisor_resume_recommendation_user_promp:
Based on the current resume corpus and job packets, recommend 3-6 short resume changes that improve hireability without inventing more work experience. Focus on sections, bullets, wording, and skills presentation.

Resume corpus:
{resume_corpus}

Job packets summary:
{job_packets}

advisor.advisor_interview_prep_user_prompt_templ:
Using the resume corpus and job packets, produce 4-6 short interview prep bullets that cover likely topics, questions, and evidence to review. Keep each bullet brief.

Resume corpus:
{resume_corpus}

Job packets summary:
{job_packets}

advisor.advisor_ats_keyword_gaps_user_prompt_tem:
Using the resume corpus and job packets, identify 4-8 concise ATS keyword gaps: important terms that appear in the jobs but are missing or weak in the resume. Keep each bullet brief.

Resume corpus:
{resume_corpus}

Job packets summary:
{job_packets}

advisor.advisor_portfolio_suggestions_user_promp:
Using the resume corpus and job packets, suggest 3-5 concise portfolio or project ideas that would improve hireability. Keep each bullet brief and practical.

Resume corpus:
{resume_corpus}

Job packets summary:
{job_packets}
